      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mover><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>",
